# Core Workflow Test

This test demonstrates the core pebbles workflow: listing, showing, updating, linking, and organizing issues.

## List all issues

```console
$ pebbles list
44444444 [epic] [TODO] User Authentication Epic (0)
33333333 [des] [TODO] JWT token authentication system
22222222 [uc] [TODO] User can login with email and password
11111111 [bug] [TODO] Login button doesn't respond on mobile

```

## Filter by status

r[verify list-filter]
```console
$ pebbles list --status todo
44444444 [epic] [TODO] User Authentication Epic (0)
33333333 [des] [TODO] JWT token authentication system
22222222 [uc] [TODO] User can login with email and password
11111111 [bug] [TODO] Login button doesn't respond on mobile

```

## Filter by issue type

```console
$ pebbles list --issue-type bug
11111111 [bug] [TODO] Login button doesn't respond on mobile

```

## Show issue details

r[verify short-id-input]
r[verify issue-filename-format]
```console
$ pebbles show 11111111
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
ID: 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
Title: Login button doesn't respond on mobile
Type: Bug
Status: TODO
Description: The login button doesn't respond to clicks on mobile devices

Created: [..]
Updated: [..]
File: bug-11111111-login-button-doesn-t-respond-on-mobile.json
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

```

## Update issue status

```console
$ pebbles status 33333333 in_progress
✓ Updated issue status
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
ID: 33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333
Title: JWT token authentication system
Type: Design
Status: IN PROGRESS
Description: Design and implement JWT-based authentication

Created: [..]
Updated: [..]
File: des-33333333-jwt-token-authentication-system.json
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

```

## Link issues to epic

r[verify part-of-epic-types]
```console
$ pebbles link 11111111 part_of 44444444
✓ Added relationship

```

```console
$ pebbles link 22222222 part_of 44444444
✓ Added relationship

```

```console
$ pebbles link 33333333 part_of 44444444
✓ Added relationship

```

## Add dependency relationship

```console
$ pebbles link 33333333 required_for 22222222
✓ Added relationship

```

## View epic with all child issues

```console
$ pebbles epic 44444444
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
Epic: User Authentication Epic
ID: 44444444
Status: TODO

Implement complete user authentication system

Progress: 0/3
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

Child Issues:
  33333333 [des] [IN PROGRESS] JWT token authentication system
  22222222 [uc] [TODO] User can login with email and password
  11111111 [bug] [TODO] Login button doesn't respond on mobile


```

## Update issue title

```console
$ pebbles update 11111111 --title "Fix mobile login button click handler"
✓ Updated issue
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
ID: 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
Title: Fix mobile login button click handler
Type: Bug
Status: TODO
Description: The login button doesn't respond to clicks on mobile devices

Relationships:
  part of 44444444 (User Authentication Epic)

Created: [..]
Updated: [..]
File: bug-11111111-fix-mobile-login-button-click-handler.json
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

```

## Complete an issue

```console
$ pebbles status 11111111 done
✓ Updated issue status
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
ID: 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
Title: Fix mobile login button click handler
Type: Bug
Status: DONE
Description: The login button doesn't respond to clicks on mobile devices

Relationships:
  part of 44444444 (User Authentication Epic)

Created: [..]
Updated: [..]
File: bug-11111111-fix-mobile-login-button-click-handler.json
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

```

