## Show what's in progress

```console
$ pebbles list --status in_progress
33333333 [des] [IN PROGRESS] JWT token authentication system

```

## Create a new issue

r[verify appropriate-length-id]
```console
$ pebbles new "Temporary test issue" --issue-type bug
Created bug [..]
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
ID: [..]
Title: Temporary test issue
Type: Bug
Status: TODO

Created: [..]
Updated: [..]
File: bug-[..]-temporary-test-issue.json
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

```

## List includes new issue

```console
$ pebbles list --issue-type bug
[..] [bug] [TODO] Temporary test issue
11111111 [bug] [DONE] Fix mobile login button click handler

```
